  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Julia Taft Fund 2022 GIZZIM Establish Photography Training Studio</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gizzim project will target 100 beneficiaries for training in photography skills, including practical application and theory, as well as production skills such as dark room photo development. Beneficiaries will include 80 refugees and 20 Kenyans.</narrative>
